(3918217, 556417, 26001, '<td valign="top">very cool!</td>', 'very cool!', '2007-07-19 12:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918219, 556808, 81390, '<td valign="top">Oh, wow. Very little abstract art does much for me, but this is beautiful! The way those nearly straight lines make a curve from the twisting is lovely, and you cropped it exactly to fit that upper left corner.<br/> <br/>Your lighting is also superb - the greys look neat, and I especially enjoy the negative space contrasting with the highly textured areas of the paper edges. I''m sure you know all this already, but hey, I''m delighted to see it!</td>', 'Oh, wow. Very little abstract art does much for me, but this is beautiful! The way those nearly straight lines make a curve from the twisting is lovely, and you cropped it exactly to fit that upper left corner. Your lighting is also superb - the greys look neat, and I especially enjoy the negative space contrasting with the highly textured areas of the paper edges. I''m sure you know all this already, but hey, I''m delighted to see it!', '2007-07-19 12:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918220, 555209, 26001, '<td valign="top">what a brilliant execution of such a simple idea. impressive!!!</td>', 'what a brilliant execution of such a simple idea. impressive!!!', '2007-07-19 12:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918236, 556616, 81390, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m a sucker because today''s my so-called "paper anniversary," but I''m impressed. You took something very mundane and lit it just enough to make it magical.<br/> <br/>The top left and bottom edges are a little too washed out for me; instead of framing it, they distract and almost look tinted yellow.<br/>Also, it might be more effective if you distinguished each person''s features a little more, but I suppose this works as well because it''s ambiguous enough that it makes even gender impossible to determine.<br/> <br/>Anyway. I got lots of thought out of this, so it did its job. Or rather, you did yours.</td>', 'Maybe I''m a sucker because today''s my so-called "paper anniversary," but I''m impressed. You took something very mundane and lit it just enough to make it magical. The top left and bottom edges are a little too washed out for me; instead of framing it, they distract and almost look tinted yellow.Also, it might be more effective if you distinguished each person''s features a little more, but I suppose this works as well because it''s ambiguous enough that it makes even gender impossible to determine. Anyway. I got lots of thought out of this, so it did its job. Or rather, you did yours.', '2007-07-19 12:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918244, 554624, 81390, '<td valign="top">The DOF is what makes this photo for me. It makes the text feel much more at home. Or maybe it''s because it''s foreign. In any case, it turned out quite nicely.</td>', 'The DOF is what makes this photo for me. It makes the text feel much more at home. Or maybe it''s because it''s foreign. In any case, it turned out quite nicely.', '2007-07-19 12:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
