(3918814, 555826, 81390, '<td valign="top">This is a nice concept, but it feels to me like the focus is in the wrong place. I want to look at that zig-zag, but the sharpness elsewhere doesn''t help, so I''m torn between what my brain wants as the subject and what my eyeballs turn to.<br/> <br/>On the other hand, it''s well lit, and I like the resulting soft shades. Since this is advanced editing, that focal point could have been sharper, but the harshness may have detracted from the overall feel you achieved.</td>', 'This is a nice concept, but it feels to me like the focus is in the wrong place. I want to look at that zig-zag, but the sharpness elsewhere doesn''t help, so I''m torn between what my brain wants as the subject and what my eyeballs turn to. On the other hand, it''s well lit, and I like the resulting soft shades. Since this is advanced editing, that focal point could have been sharper, but the harshness may have detracted from the overall feel you achieved.', '2007-07-19 15:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
