(3918817, 555458, 81390, '<td valign="top">Pretty funny, but the bee needs to be brighter because I didn''t get what the title meant at first. Plus, in considering composition, the bright yellows would match nicely. I realize this was probably (sorry if I''m wrong) just lucky timing, but the focus is misleading. I look at the plane, then the plants, then find the bee and the humor.</td>', 'Pretty funny, but the bee needs to be brighter because I didn''t get what the title meant at first. Plus, in considering composition, the bright yellows would match nicely. I realize this was probably (sorry if I''m wrong) just lucky timing, but the focus is misleading. I look at the plane, then the plants, then find the bee and the humor.', '2007-07-19 16:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
