(3919347, 554508, 76430, '<td valign="top">Similar to earlier shots, but the viewpoint from inside the curved paper is really a big creative improvement.  I would try to figure out a way to get rid of the blur caused by the pages together in the middle of the heart near the lens, maybe by not running the paper down to the binding but gluing the paper edges together at the top of the heart.</td>', 'Similar to earlier shots, but the viewpoint from inside the curved paper is really a big creative improvement.  I would try to figure out a way to get rid of the blur caused by the pages together in the middle of the heart near the lens, maybe by not running the paper down to the binding but gluing the paper edges together at the top of the heart.', '2007-07-19 18:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
