(3919369, 557008, 76430, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the dog is pretty drab, but otherwise excellent shot!  If you could blow the cape up with a fan or fishing line it would be better, but I can imagine even getting the dog to cooperate with this was difficult.  Did you clone out the wires or stands?  I don''t see any trace of support.  I do see a little sharpening halo on the tip of the airplane.</td>', 'The lighting on the dog is pretty drab, but otherwise excellent shot!  If you could blow the cape up with a fan or fishing line it would be better, but I can imagine even getting the dog to cooperate with this was difficult.  Did you clone out the wires or stands?  I don''t see any trace of support.  I do see a little sharpening halo on the tip of the airplane.', '2007-07-19 18:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
