(3920670, 557042, 37252, '<td valign="top">hmmm - per the details of the Challenge: Make an image with paper as its subject, or where the subject is made of paper.<br/> <br/>Your image - without use of the title - implies the fly as your subject.<br/>It''s a really nice macro, but not really meeting the challenge. I''m not a total DNMC nazi, so I''m only taking one point away.</td>', 'hmmm - per the details of the Challenge: Make an image with paper as its subject, or where the subject is made of paper. Your image - without use of the title - implies the fly as your subject.It''s a really nice macro, but not really meeting the challenge. I''m not a total DNMC nazi, so I''m only taking one point away.', '2007-07-20 01:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920673, 555395, 37252, '<td valign="top">I would have chosen a different background. The bird would have stood out more</td>', 'I would have chosen a different background. The bird would have stood out more', '2007-07-20 01:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
