(3920711, 556793, 37252, '<td valign="top">I think your attempt at the single lighting was done pretty well. Being nit picky, I would have liked to see the brightest light point right in the center of the origami star</td>', 'I think your attempt at the single lighting was done pretty well. Being nit picky, I would have liked to see the brightest light point right in the center of the origami star', '2007-07-20 02:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920712, 556809, 37252, '<td valign="top">kinda cheesy :/</td>', 'kinda cheesy :/', '2007-07-20 02:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920713, 556391, 37252, '<td valign="top">not bad - just lacks any ''wow''</td>', 'not bad - just lacks any ''wow''', '2007-07-20 02:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920716, 554551, 37252, '<td valign="top">cute idea. Nice DOF</td>', 'cute idea. Nice DOF', '2007-07-20 02:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920717, 554472, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very pretty pastels</td>', 'Very pretty pastels', '2007-07-20 02:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920718, 556152, 37252, '<td valign="top">great job - love the pp</td>', 'great job - love the pp', '2007-07-20 02:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920721, 556220, 45672, '<td valign="top">Nice going Michael Bolton.  (ha)  Great photo.</td>', 'Nice going Michael Bolton.  (ha)  Great photo.', '2007-07-20 02:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920725, 556793, 45672, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the lighting.  Good use of a snoot.</td>', 'Nice job with the lighting.  Good use of a snoot.', '2007-07-20 02:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920827, 553865, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  I''d like to see a little more contrast in the lighting, with more shadows.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  I''d like to see a little more contrast in the lighting, with more shadows.', '2007-07-20 03:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920829, 556779, 39430, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but I don''t like the background.  The lighting is also a little wierd, with a big shadow right in the centre.</td>', 'Not bad, but I don''t like the background.  The lighting is also a little wierd, with a big shadow right in the centre.', '2007-07-20 03:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920830, 555303, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice cutout, but you are going to get caned for the camera shake.  :)</td>', 'Nice cutout, but you are going to get caned for the camera shake.  :)', '2007-07-20 03:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920832, 556220, 39430, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured it well, while showing very little.  I''d like to see a closer crop without the top or bottom of this image.</td>', 'You''ve captured it well, while showing very little.  I''d like to see a closer crop without the top or bottom of this image.', '2007-07-20 03:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920834, 556775, 39430, '<td valign="top">Looks like very heavy has eaten up the detail.</td>', 'Looks like very heavy has eaten up the detail.', '2007-07-20 03:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920836, 556740, 39430, '<td valign="top">Too dark and saturated for my liking, but an interesting title.  :)</td>', 'Too dark and saturated for my liking, but an interesting title.  :)', '2007-07-20 03:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920838, 556549, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, but the colours are really wrong, and too over saturated.  I like the timing of the sea around the bottle.</td>', 'Nice setup, but the colours are really wrong, and too over saturated.  I like the timing of the sea around the bottle.', '2007-07-20 03:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920839, 554498, 39430, '<td valign="top">The setup is black and white, but desatting it has lost the subtle colours of reality, so it looks a little blank.  Nice pseudo shadows though.</td>', 'The setup is black and white, but desatting it has lost the subtle colours of reality, so it looks a little blank.  Nice pseudo shadows though.', '2007-07-20 03:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920840, 557079, 39430, '<td valign="top">Highlights are very blown and harsh looking.  Oh, please tell me where you took this shot.  I want a cutting from that tree.</td>', 'Highlights are very blown and harsh looking.  Oh, please tell me where you took this shot.  I want a cutting from that tree.', '2007-07-20 03:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920841, 556854, 39430, '<td valign="top">The desat is a bit severe next to the bright yellow, and I feel the background is too busy to do well in BW.</td>', 'The desat is a bit severe next to the bright yellow, and I feel the background is too busy to do well in BW.', '2007-07-20 03:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920849, 554508, 39430, '<td valign="top">The blurred line down the centre is a pity, but the heart is a nice effect.</td>', 'The blurred line down the centre is a pity, but the heart is a nice effect.', '2007-07-20 03:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920851, 555458, 39430, '<td valign="top">The bee is actually quite hidden.  I didn''t see it at first.  It''s a pity the whole plane is out of focus.</td>', 'The bee is actually quite hidden.  I didn''t see it at first.  It''s a pity the whole plane is out of focus.', '2007-07-20 03:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920852, 556948, 39430, '<td valign="top">The colour has leaked in the editing.  Nice frame, although some people might mark down for a frame like this.</td>', 'The colour has leaked in the editing.  Nice frame, although some people might mark down for a frame like this.', '2007-07-20 04:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920854, 556152, 39430, '<td valign="top">It''s a little lacking in colour variation.  The sweeping curves make a nice composition.</td>', 'It''s a little lacking in colour variation.  The sweeping curves make a nice composition.', '2007-07-20 04:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920856, 554890, 39430, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the solarised look. Sorry. :(</td>', 'I don''t like the solarised look. Sorry. :(', '2007-07-20 04:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920858, 556567, 39430, '<td valign="top">This would be better without the background, and maybe some more contrasty lighting.</td>', 'This would be better without the background, and maybe some more contrasty lighting.', '2007-07-20 04:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920860, 556732, 39430, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a nice flame!  Is it just wax burning, or did you add something more flammable?</td>', 'Wow, this is a nice flame!  Is it just wax burning, or did you add something more flammable?', '2007-07-20 04:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920861, 555385, 39430, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and composition, but I''m not sure I understand the photo or the title.</td>', 'I like the colours and composition, but I''m not sure I understand the photo or the title.', '2007-07-20 04:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920862, 556876, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice inky water and reflections.  The vignette is a little awkward looking, or maybe it''s shadows in the reflections., but it gets light again, right at the edge.</td>', 'Nice inky water and reflections.  The vignette is a little awkward looking, or maybe it''s shadows in the reflections., but it gets light again, right at the edge.', '2007-07-20 04:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920863, 555537, 77577, '<td valign="top">nice photo but what lowered my vote was the dust marks under the plane and in the upper left hand corner as this is in advanced editting IMO these should have been removed</td>', 'nice photo but what lowered my vote was the dust marks under the plane and in the upper left hand corner as this is in advanced editting IMO these should have been removed', '2007-07-20 04:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920864, 554439, 77577, '<td valign="top">The concept is interesting but seems to be lacking in a certain oomf the flash is distracting as well</td>', 'The concept is interesting but seems to be lacking in a certain oomf the flash is distracting as well', '2007-07-20 04:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920866, 556803, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, but I''d like to see more light on the crane, and less on the background.</td>', 'Nice setup, but I''d like to see more light on the crane, and less on the background.', '2007-07-20 04:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920868, 556994, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure quite what this is about, but it looks cool.  :)</td>', 'I''m not sure quite what this is about, but it looks cool.  :)', '2007-07-20 04:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920869, 556609, 39430, '<td valign="top">It looks a little blurry, possibly camera shake from a slow shutter speed.</td>', 'It looks a little blurry, possibly camera shake from a slow shutter speed.', '2007-07-20 04:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920870, 555860, 39430, '<td valign="top">Good ol'' mobius.  The lighting is nice and direct, maybe slightly harsh, but the frayed edges of the paper is distracting.  Could also do with a little bit of colour.</td>', 'Good ol'' mobius.  The lighting is nice and direct, maybe slightly harsh, but the frayed edges of the paper is distracting.  Could also do with a little bit of colour.', '2007-07-20 04:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920871, 556985, 77577, '<td valign="top">would have liked to see an active background maybe even an empty hallway at a school to but it more in context here it seems a little sterile</td>', 'would have liked to see an active background maybe even an empty hallway at a school to but it more in context here it seems a little sterile', '2007-07-20 04:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920872, 557075, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''m not very keen on the noisy saturated false colouring.</td>', 'I''m not very keen on the noisy saturated false colouring.', '2007-07-20 04:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920874, 555771, 39430, '<td valign="top">Wierd idea.  Nice photo, but it lacks some deeper shadows, particularly the bright background.</td>', 'Wierd idea.  Nice photo, but it lacks some deeper shadows, particularly the bright background.', '2007-07-20 04:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920875, 554095, 77577, '<td valign="top">what is it? the graininess is distracting</td>', 'what is it? the graininess is distracting', '2007-07-20 04:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920876, 555700, 39430, '<td valign="top">It looks misty, or something, lacking in contrast.  I''m not sure why.  Maybe as a result of purposely blowing the highlights for the white background.</td>', 'It looks misty, or something, lacking in contrast.  I''m not sure why.  Maybe as a result of purposely blowing the highlights for the white background.', '2007-07-20 04:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920877, 556496, 39430, '<td valign="top">The very thin DOF makes most of the image look soft.  Would be better with a smaller aperture.</td>', 'The very thin DOF makes most of the image look soft.  Would be better with a smaller aperture.', '2007-07-20 04:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920878, 555571, 77577, '<td valign="top">the orange conjures up a feeling of an office in the 70''s. which isn''t a bad thing at all, it created an interesting emotion</td>', 'the orange conjures up a feeling of an office in the 70''s. which isn''t a bad thing at all, it created an interesting emotion', '2007-07-20 04:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920882, 554286, 39430, '<td valign="top">Oooh, baby, yeah!  Be still my beating heart.  :)  Great job.</td>', 'Oooh, baby, yeah!  Be still my beating heart.  :)  Great job.', '2007-07-20 04:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920884, 556458, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern, but lacks an interesting point of focus.  It''s a little blurry, and the detail is lost.</td>', 'Nice pattern, but lacks an interesting point of focus.  It''s a little blurry, and the detail is lost.', '2007-07-20 04:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920885, 556412, 77577, '<td valign="top">love the tweaked out look on your subjects face!! made me laugh</td>', 'love the tweaked out look on your subjects face!! made me laugh', '2007-07-20 04:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920886, 554123, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice scene.  Pity someone scribbled on your lamp.  :)  What''s the cord and the bottle top there for?</td>', 'Nice scene.  Pity someone scribbled on your lamp.  :)  What''s the cord and the bottle top there for?', '2007-07-20 04:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920887, 556549, 77577, '<td valign="top">the background seams over processed especially on the horizon line</td>', 'the background seams over processed especially on the horizon line', '2007-07-20 04:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920888, 555766, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice work on the panning, and great light on the plane.  Would be even better if the plane was bigger, but I suspect you are already cropped right in.</td>', 'Nice work on the panning, and great light on the plane.  Would be even better if the plane was bigger, but I suspect you are already cropped right in.', '2007-07-20 04:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920890, 556541, 39430, '<td valign="top">A little over-processed with the sharpening and the colours.  Nice plane design though.</td>', 'A little over-processed with the sharpening and the colours.  Nice plane design though.', '2007-07-20 04:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920892, 557063, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice misty softness to this image, but unfortunately it also looks a little blurry.  I would also try a closer crop, removing the edges.</td>', 'Nice misty softness to this image, but unfortunately it also looks a little blurry.  I would also try a closer crop, removing the edges.', '2007-07-20 04:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920895, 556726, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and a good crisp shot.  I''m glad you''ve left the colour in, where others have similar entries in full BW.  It''s still not really a world inspiring image, but you''ve done the concept reasonably well.</td>', 'Nice DOF and a good crisp shot.  I''m glad you''ve left the colour in, where others have similar entries in full BW.  It''s still not really a world inspiring image, but you''ve done the concept reasonably well.', '2007-07-20 04:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920896, 553886, 39430, '<td valign="top">A good concept, but it looks like it was taken on a low-quality camera phone, and the image quality and contrast is not good.</td>', 'A good concept, but it looks like it was taken on a low-quality camera phone, and the image quality and contrast is not good.', '2007-07-20 04:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920897, 555026, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nic lighting setup.</td>', 'Nic lighting setup.', '2007-07-20 04:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920898, 556848, 39430, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed and saturated.</td>', 'A bit overexposed and saturated.', '2007-07-20 04:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920900, 556944, 39430, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand the title, but you did a great job on the prop!  With some more professional lighting, this would have been a top shot.</td>', 'I don''t really understand the title, but you did a great job on the prop!  With some more professional lighting, this would have been a top shot.', '2007-07-20 04:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920903, 556985, 24074, '<td valign="top">Like the idea, too much contrast for me but I think it works with the clean-cut nature of the image</td>', 'Like the idea, too much contrast for me but I think it works with the clean-cut nature of the image', '2007-07-20 04:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920904, 557046, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hey, I know that guy!  What are the spots of light below?  Could also use some diffused fill light to just lightly touch the shadow areas and reduce the harsh contrasts, and show some more shadow detail.</td>', 'Hey, I know that guy!  What are the spots of light below?  Could also use some diffused fill light to just lightly touch the shadow areas and reduce the harsh contrasts, and show some more shadow detail.', '2007-07-20 04:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920905, 553886, 24074, '<td valign="top">It is a great idea but the image is out of focus and blurred. I think if you would have used a shorter shutter speed or a tripod it would have worked much better. Good Luck</td>', 'It is a great idea but the image is out of focus and blurred. I think if you would have used a shorter shutter speed or a tripod it would have worked much better. Good Luck', '2007-07-20 04:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920908, 555537, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice plane, and very good composition.  The only thing I don''t like is that particular shade of blue, but that''s my problem.  The background texture along the bottom is great.  I''d like to see more of it in the rest of the image.</td>', 'Nice plane, and very good composition.  The only thing I don''t like is that particular shade of blue, but that''s my problem.  The background texture along the bottom is great.  I''d like to see more of it in the rest of the image.', '2007-07-20 04:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920909, 555185, 39430, '<td valign="top">Better focus and a little sharpening would help to crisp it up.</td>', 'Better focus and a little sharpening would help to crisp it up.', '2007-07-20 04:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920910, 556527, 24074, '<td valign="top">I like the image very much. I think it is very popping but the title does not make sence to me. the contrast gives this image a good feeling and I like what the border does to it. I would like to see a little more focus on the boy''s face. Good Luck!</td>', 'I like the image very much. I think it is very popping but the title does not make sence to me. the contrast gives this image a good feeling and I like what the border does to it. I would like to see a little more focus on the boy''s face. Good Luck!', '2007-07-20 04:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920911, 555158, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice raked lighting over the edge.</td>', 'Nice raked lighting over the edge.', '2007-07-20 04:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920912, 556660, 24074, '<td valign="top">Neat image but not much more. The shallow DOF makes the image but it does not make it for me.</td>', 'Neat image but not much more. The shallow DOF makes the image but it does not make it for me.', '2007-07-20 04:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920913, 557052, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes.  It would be even better if there were more shadows to help define the shapes better.</td>', 'Nice shapes.  It would be even better if there were more shadows to help define the shapes better.', '2007-07-20 04:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920914, 555826, 24074, '<td valign="top">Yes, very abstract but it works. I like it but the only thing is I would like to see a little mor dark tones. the whole image seems to be on the grey side but the pure white helps make it intresting.</td>', 'Yes, very abstract but it works. I like it but the only thing is I would like to see a little mor dark tones. the whole image seems to be on the grey side but the pure white helps make it intresting.', '2007-07-20 04:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920915, 557036, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice flames.  I can almost see a face in there.</td>', 'Nice flames.  I can almost see a face in there.', '2007-07-20 04:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920916, 554551, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice setup.  The grass is not quite green enough, but maybe you live in Australia, and all the grass here is dead anyway.  I like the crispness of this shot, as well as the shallow DOF.</td>', 'Nice setup.  The grass is not quite green enough, but maybe you live in Australia, and all the grass here is dead anyway.  I like the crispness of this shot, as well as the shallow DOF.', '2007-07-20 04:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920917, 556808, 24074, '<td valign="top">I like it but would like to see a little sharper focus. Good Luck</td>', 'I like it but would like to see a little sharper focus. Good Luck', '2007-07-20 04:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920918, 555785, 39430, '<td valign="top">Ohh, very stylish lighting.  There''s some very cool planes in this challenge, and the simple plane looks a little bland by comparison, although it is elegant.  I''d like to see some colour left in this image.  The total BW loses all warmth.</td>', 'Ohh, very stylish lighting.  There''s some very cool planes in this challenge, and the simple plane looks a little bland by comparison, although it is elegant.  I''d like to see some colour left in this image.  The total BW loses all warmth.', '2007-07-20 04:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920920, 556724, 39430, '<td valign="top">It''s a good angle for the photo, but a strange angle for the lighting.  If you can, get the light up above, where it will look more natural.</td>', 'It''s a good angle for the photo, but a strange angle for the lighting.  If you can, get the light up above, where it will look more natural.', '2007-07-20 04:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920922, 555826, 39430, '<td valign="top">An abstract needs something a little more enticing, making a design with colour, shapes or contrast.  The blurry shape doesn''t hold my attention.</td>', 'An abstract needs something a little more enticing, making a design with colour, shapes or contrast.  The blurry shape doesn''t hold my attention.', '2007-07-20 04:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920925, 554344, 39430, '<td valign="top">This is funny.  When I was buying my camera, I downloaded photos off the net, printed them out and stuck them together like a real camera.  I had a D80 and a 400D, with full realistic details.  I hope you had as much fun as I did.  It would be nice to set this up like a product photo shoot, with the fancy lighting, and the softbox, and reflective benchtop and all.</td>', 'This is funny.  When I was buying my camera, I downloaded photos off the net, printed them out and stuck them together like a real camera.  I had a D80 and a 400D, with full realistic details.  I hope you had as much fun as I did.  It would be nice to set this up like a product photo shoot, with the fancy lighting, and the softbox, and reflective benchtop and all.', '2007-07-20 04:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920926, 556974, 39430, '<td valign="top">I like this, with the grater almost hidden.  Nice range of colours in the paper too.</td>', 'I like this, with the grater almost hidden.  Nice range of colours in the paper too.', '2007-07-20 04:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920927, 556873, 39430, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but I''m curious to know more about what this is, and the photo doesn''t tell me much.</td>', 'Not bad, but I''m curious to know more about what this is, and the photo doesn''t tell me much.', '2007-07-20 04:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
