(3920929, 555404, 39430, '<td valign="top">The focus point should be a little closer, so that more of "paper" is in focus, and less of "papaya".  You could probably make it about 2 lines closer.</td>', 'The focus point should be a little closer, so that more of "paper" is in focus, and less of "papaya".  You could probably make it about 2 lines closer.', '2007-07-20 04:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
