(3920979, 556486, 39430, '<td valign="top">Enticing.  I like the composition, but not so much the colour.  A little USM would help crisp it up.</td>', 'Enticing.  I like the composition, but not so much the colour.  A little USM would help crisp it up.', '2007-07-20 06:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
