(3920992, 555541, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''m not big on flower photos, but these are not so bad.  I like the subtle colours mixed in with the overall brown.</td>', 'I''m not big on flower photos, but these are not so bad.  I like the subtle colours mixed in with the overall brown.', '2007-07-20 07:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
