(3920994, 556746, 39430, '<td valign="top">The eyes are a little dark.  It''s advanced editing, so you can bring up the eyes to help them stand out, and sharpen the image a little.  Overall, I like the crop and the closeness, emphasising the emotion.</td>', 'The eyes are a little dark.  It''s advanced editing, so you can bring up the eyes to help them stand out, and sharpen the image a little.  Overall, I like the crop and the closeness, emphasising the emotion.', '2007-07-20 07:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3920995, 556943, 39430, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  I assume they are stuck on a window.  My only comment is that the top one doesn''t look like a plane.  Is it supposed to be a dog maybe?  I can''t figure it out.</td>', 'Not bad.  I assume they are stuck on a window.  My only comment is that the top one doesn''t look like a plane.  Is it supposed to be a dog maybe?  I can''t figure it out.', '2007-07-20 07:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921000, 556338, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice balance.  It''s quite a cluttered image with all the messy paper and extra props, but it kinda works for this theme.  I like the crispness of all the details.</td>', 'Nice balance.  It''s quite a cluttered image with all the messy paper and extra props, but it kinda works for this theme.  I like the crispness of all the details.', '2007-07-20 07:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921001, 555642, 39430, '<td valign="top">Oh, very nice setup.  Like the night before christmas.  The skeleton is just slightly soft, but overall, I really like this.</td>', 'Oh, very nice setup.  Like the night before christmas.  The skeleton is just slightly soft, but overall, I really like this.', '2007-07-20 07:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921002, 554919, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''ve always struggled with these 2 colours together, so that''s bothering me a little.</td>', 'I''ve always struggled with these 2 colours together, so that''s bothering me a little.', '2007-07-20 07:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921003, 555020, 39430, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Great sculpture.  I hope you didn''t do this yourself, just for the challenge.  :)  The girraffe on the side is distracting.  Either put it in, or crop it out fully.  I''d pick out.</td>', 'Wow.  Great sculpture.  I hope you didn''t do this yourself, just for the challenge.  :)  The girraffe on the side is distracting.  Either put it in, or crop it out fully.  I''d pick out.', '2007-07-20 07:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921005, 557000, 39430, '<td valign="top">A nice photo, but the paper is very incidental to the photo.  It''s not even possible to tell if the background is paper or not.</td>', 'A nice photo, but the paper is very incidental to the photo.  It''s not even possible to tell if the background is paper or not.', '2007-07-20 07:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921006, 554163, 39430, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally like abstracts, but this is really nice.  I love the colours and the shapes.  I''d love to see how you did it.</td>', 'I don''t normally like abstracts, but this is really nice.  I love the colours and the shapes.  I''d love to see how you did it.', '2007-07-20 07:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921007, 556954, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting layout.  The low contrast doesn''t help it stand out very well.  I like the overall composition and balance.</td>', 'Interesting layout.  The low contrast doesn''t help it stand out very well.  I like the overall composition and balance.', '2007-07-20 07:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921008, 554439, 39430, '<td valign="top">The flash reflection in the centre is not so good.</td>', 'The flash reflection in the centre is not so good.', '2007-07-20 07:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
