(3921010, 556612, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  Looks like either a negative image, or you''ve lit it through the paper from underneath.  Ether way, it''s very effective.</td>', 'Nice abstract.  Looks like either a negative image, or you''ve lit it through the paper from underneath.  Ether way, it''s very effective.', '2007-07-20 07:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921012, 556660, 39430, '<td valign="top">The colours are a little too much for me to give top marks, but still quite nice.</td>', 'The colours are a little too much for me to give top marks, but still quite nice.', '2007-07-20 07:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921015, 555571, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting motion blur effect with the pages.</td>', 'Interesting motion blur effect with the pages.', '2007-07-20 07:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921017, 556527, 80084, '<td valign="top">This photo seems to tell a story, as the titel states "oh boy" a newspaper could very well be an exciting thing for these boys. alot of emotion is bought out. and alot of efort must have gone into it.</td>', 'This photo seems to tell a story, as the titel states "oh boy" a newspaper could very well be an exciting thing for these boys. alot of emotion is bought out. and alot of efort must have gone into it.', '2007-07-20 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921018, 555334, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice shape, but it somehow lacks with it''s colour and lighting.</td>', 'Nice shape, but it somehow lacks with it''s colour and lighting.', '2007-07-20 07:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921019, 556385, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a wider crop, with more at the top.</td>', 'I''d like to see a wider crop, with more at the top.', '2007-07-20 07:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921022, 556744, 39430, '<td valign="top">Yep, our kids do this.  This photo seems a little not crisp.  Maybe too much noise filtering?  A good way to limit noise in BW images is to throw away the blue channel, because it''s always noisier than the others.  Nice doggie.  Looks like our Silky Terrier, but ours of course is not white.</td>', 'Yep, our kids do this.  This photo seems a little not crisp.  Maybe too much noise filtering?  A good way to limit noise in BW images is to throw away the blue channel, because it''s always noisier than the others.  Nice doggie.  Looks like our Silky Terrier, but ours of course is not white.', '2007-07-20 07:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921023, 557042, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  Could be closer in though.</td>', 'Nice macro.  Could be closer in though.', '2007-07-20 07:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921024, 554864, 39430, '<td valign="top">A smaller aperture would help to bring the back duck into focus better.</td>', 'A smaller aperture would help to bring the back duck into focus better.', '2007-07-20 07:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921027, 555763, 39430, '<td valign="top">A familiar idea after Shannon''s lucky 7 entry.  :)  Not bad, but the total desay of the hand leaves it looking a little dead.</td>', 'A familiar idea after Shannon''s lucky 7 entry.  :)  Not bad, but the total desay of the hand leaves it looking a little dead.', '2007-07-20 07:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921028, 556768, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice workshop.  :)  The lower edge of the photo has a strange misty look, which is a little odd.</td>', 'Nice workshop.  :)  The lower edge of the photo has a strange misty look, which is a little odd.', '2007-07-20 07:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921029, 556285, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  Maybe too much so.  However, I like the contrast of the nice deep blacks and the bright edge.  You''ve used the available dynamic range well.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  Maybe too much so.  However, I like the contrast of the nice deep blacks and the bright edge.  You''ve used the available dynamic range well.', '2007-07-20 07:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921030, 556417, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice negative effect!</td>', 'Nice negative effect!', '2007-07-20 07:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921031, 556331, 39430, '<td valign="top">Great colours, and nice sillhouette.  I think this will score well.</td>', 'Great colours, and nice sillhouette.  I think this will score well.', '2007-07-20 07:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921032, 554472, 39430, '<td valign="top">Someone else did this one, and I think they did it better.  The backlighting doesn''t quite work as well.</td>', 'Someone else did this one, and I think they did it better.  The backlighting doesn''t quite work as well.', '2007-07-20 07:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921034, 556484, 39430, '<td valign="top">Funny.  :)  I''d like it better it they were positioned closer together, instead of looking like they don''t want to catch anything from each other.  You''ve captured the typical lighting of this type of scene, which is great, but a little more highlight would help make use of the full available dynamic range.</td>', 'Funny.  :)  I''d like it better it they were positioned closer together, instead of looking like they don''t want to catch anything from each other.  You''ve captured the typical lighting of this type of scene, which is great, but a little more highlight would help make use of the full available dynamic range.', '2007-07-20 07:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921035, 557033, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  With advanced editing, a little darkening of the sky and lightening of the rocks would help balance the tones, and also bring out some more foreground detail.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  With advanced editing, a little darkening of the sky and lightening of the rocks would help balance the tones, and also bring out some more foreground detail.', '2007-07-20 07:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921036, 556781, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very funny.  The pink is rather overpowering.  I love his expression.</td>', 'Very funny.  The pink is rather overpowering.  I love his expression.', '2007-07-20 07:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921038, 556985, 39430, '<td valign="top">The background is just a little too light.  Other than that, nice image.</td>', 'The background is just a little too light.  Other than that, nice image.', '2007-07-20 07:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921039, 555395, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp details, although if the focus point was just a little further back, the back wing could probably be in focus too, and it would stand out even better from the background.</td>', 'Nice crisp details, although if the focus point was just a little further back, the back wing could probably be in focus too, and it would stand out even better from the background.', '2007-07-20 07:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921040, 556527, 39430, '<td valign="top">The large radius USM is a little severe.  Other than that, this would have been an excellent image.</td>', 'The large radius USM is a little severe.  Other than that, this would have been an excellent image.', '2007-07-20 07:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921041, 556180, 39430, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the grainy effect here.</td>', 'I don''t really like the grainy effect here.', '2007-07-20 07:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921042, 556616, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect.  You''ve used the paper to shape the light and shadows very nicely.</td>', 'Very interesting effect.  You''ve used the paper to shape the light and shadows very nicely.', '2007-07-20 07:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921043, 556468, 39430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours in the landscape.  The background almost looks like a painting of an english garden.</td>', 'Beautiful colours in the landscape.  The background almost looks like a painting of an english garden.', '2007-07-20 07:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
