(3921059, 555151, 39430, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  It''s a bit like a book that I read my kids.  :)  The white balance is a lot on the blue side though.</td>', 'Cool idea.  It''s a bit like a book that I read my kids.  :)  The white balance is a lot on the blue side though.', '2007-07-20 08:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921063, 554839, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I can figure this one out, or it''s link to the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not sure I can figure this one out, or it''s link to the challenge.', '2007-07-20 08:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921066, 556957, 39430, '<td valign="top">This is quite out of focus, and I think the voters will notice!  Good idea to colour the water.</td>', 'This is quite out of focus, and I think the voters will notice!  Good idea to colour the water.', '2007-07-20 08:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921068, 557066, 39430, '<td valign="top">There''s so much detail down the image, I''d prefer to see more of it in focus.</td>', 'There''s so much detail down the image, I''d prefer to see more of it in focus.', '2007-07-20 08:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921070, 554157, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice creative viewpoint, but the curtains don''t really add anything to the image.  Hard to crop from this shot without ruining the balance, but different camera positioning could setup a closer-crop shot without the curtains.</td>', 'Nice creative viewpoint, but the curtains don''t really add anything to the image.  Hard to crop from this shot without ruining the balance, but different camera positioning could setup a closer-crop shot without the curtains.', '2007-07-20 08:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921071, 557055, 39430, '<td valign="top">This is a cool effect.  Looks almost like an airbrush painting with it''s crisp lines and smooth gradients.</td>', 'This is a cool effect.  Looks almost like an airbrush painting with it''s crisp lines and smooth gradients.', '2007-07-20 08:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921072, 557078, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting shape, but I don''t much like the colour.</td>', 'Interesting shape, but I don''t much like the colour.', '2007-07-20 08:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921075, 556391, 39430, '<td valign="top">The first thing I notice is the centred composition, so you can''t see much of the nice beach, but I guess that''s the point.  They are missing the scenery.  I like that you just see the top of their head, buried in the paper.  It just lacks a little punch.  A slight S-curve in the levels would help to pop it out, or whatever editing methods you are comfortable with.</td>', 'The first thing I notice is the centred composition, so you can''t see much of the nice beach, but I guess that''s the point.  They are missing the scenery.  I like that you just see the top of their head, buried in the paper.  It just lacks a little punch.  A slight S-curve in the levels would help to pop it out, or whatever editing methods you are comfortable with.', '2007-07-20 08:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921079, 555592, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  This must have taken ages to stick them on.  I like the photo expressions.  My main dislike is the colour, with it''s very brown cast, and red-brown skin tones.  Match the camera''s white balance to the light, or fix it in software.</td>', 'Nice work.  This must have taken ages to stick them on.  I like the photo expressions.  My main dislike is the colour, with it''s very brown cast, and red-brown skin tones.  Match the camera''s white balance to the light, or fix it in software.', '2007-07-20 08:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921083, 554441, 39430, '<td valign="top">A closer-crop would still include everything important.  You could take 30% off the right and the bottom, and a little off the left without losing anything.  The focus is good on the pin.</td>', 'A closer-crop would still include everything important.  You could take 30% off the right and the bottom, and a little off the left without losing anything.  The focus is good on the pin.', '2007-07-20 08:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921084, 555859, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract lines.</td>', 'Nice abstract lines.', '2007-07-20 08:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921085, 556174, 39430, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I can''t see how you did it.  The colour balance is a little cool, and the vignette is a little plastic looking, but the balance of the whole shot is good.</td>', 'Well done.  I can''t see how you did it.  The colour balance is a little cool, and the vignette is a little plastic looking, but the balance of the whole shot is good.', '2007-07-20 08:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921089, 556460, 39430, '<td valign="top">The blue is very stark against the black background with nothing to break it up.</td>', 'The blue is very stark against the black background with nothing to break it up.', '2007-07-20 08:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921093, 555381, 39430, '<td valign="top">The selective desat makes the colours of the paper look a bit ood.</td>', 'The selective desat makes the colours of the paper look a bit ood.', '2007-07-20 08:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921100, 556644, 39430, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, and the small bit of floor at the front of the image helps.  Maybe even a bit more would be good.  Also, you''ve lined up all the breaks in the chains up the centre of the image.  Maybe it would have been better to stagger them, or tape them together, so the image wouldn''t be cut in half.</td>', 'I like the lighting, and the small bit of floor at the front of the image helps.  Maybe even a bit more would be good.  Also, you''ve lined up all the breaks in the chains up the centre of the image.  Maybe it would have been better to stagger them, or tape them together, so the image wouldn''t be cut in half.', '2007-07-20 08:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921101, 556793, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  The curves seem to lack the deepest blacks though.  Check the histogram.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  The curves seem to lack the deepest blacks though.  Check the histogram.', '2007-07-20 08:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921102, 555409, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and composition.</td>', 'Nice tones and composition.', '2007-07-20 08:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921122, 556391, 39429, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I thought you might be shooting for this challenge when I saw you taking this series.</td>', 'Very nice.  I thought you might be shooting for this challenge when I saw you taking this series.', '2007-07-20 09:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921123, 555771, 39429, '<td valign="top">Creative and well shot.  Some small details- the paper doesn''t quite match the profile of the apple.  The dof doesn''t quite feel right with the front of the apple oof.  Overall nice with a great 1st impression.</td>', 'Creative and well shot.  Some small details- the paper doesn''t quite match the profile of the apple.  The dof doesn''t quite feel right with the front of the apple oof.  Overall nice with a great 1st impression.', '2007-07-20 09:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921132, 556549, 53098, '<td valign="top">nice mood &amp; colour</td>', 'nice mood & colour', '2007-07-20 09:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921137, 556781, 39429, '<td valign="top">I''m caught between the sharp, graphic nature of the shot, and the items that make this shot not work for me.<br/> <br/>The colors, framing within the picture and sharp focus work well for you.  The match of bg color with many post it notes works well.<br/> <br/>The details, including the mismatch of color between shirt and bg, the unshaved neck, strange lighting (funny shadows), pink border and the tape around the head leave me cold.<br/> <br/>It''s obvious you have talent, but this shot didn''t work for me very well.</td>', 'I''m caught between the sharp, graphic nature of the shot, and the items that make this shot not work for me. The colors, framing within the picture and sharp focus work well for you.  The match of bg color with many post it notes works well. The details, including the mismatch of color between shirt and bg, the unshaved neck, strange lighting (funny shadows), pink border and the tape around the head leave me cold. It''s obvious you have talent, but this shot didn''t work for me very well.', '2007-07-20 09:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921141, 555766, 39429, '<td valign="top">Nicely created plane, and the capture during flight works.  The dof and bg don''t add to this shot, just leave it as ordinary.</td>', 'Nicely created plane, and the capture during flight works.  The dof and bg don''t add to this shot, just leave it as ordinary.', '2007-07-20 09:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921144, 556808, 53098, '<td valign="top">nice one</td>', 'nice one', '2007-07-20 09:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921148, 556974, 39429, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  A different setup may have taken you further.  <br/> <br/>Graters usually leave a very identifiable pile shape.  Using that shape and perhaps having the grater above the shredded paper may have given you better mileage.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  A different setup may have taken you further.   Graters usually leave a very identifiable pile shape.  Using that shape and perhaps having the grater above the shredded paper may have given you better mileage.', '2007-07-20 09:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921153, 555859, 39429, '<td valign="top">A beautiful, abstract take on this challenge.  The lighting and colors really work for you here.  You''ve taken it from a traditional photo to near painting, which may work for you, but probably will work against you at DPC.  I love it.  It really works for me.</td>', 'A beautiful, abstract take on this challenge.  The lighting and colors really work for you here.  You''ve taken it from a traditional photo to near painting, which may work for you, but probably will work against you at DPC.  I love it.  It really works for me.', '2007-07-20 09:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921155, 556178, 53098, '<td valign="top">creative...</td>', 'creative...', '2007-07-20 09:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921157, 556180, 39429, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see even more grunge treatment on this shot - of course, that''s outside the rules for this challenge.<br/> <br/>The processing works for the subject.</td>', 'I''d love to see even more grunge treatment on this shot - of course, that''s outside the rules for this challenge. The processing works for the subject.', '2007-07-20 09:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921164, 557075, 39429, '<td valign="top">the composition is strong, but other items take it out of strength for me.  The bright blue spot, the strong shadows, the fight for visual attention that is going on with the lettering, over saturated blues, the lettering behind the fence, the large black post and the sack on the bench.</td>', 'the composition is strong, but other items take it out of strength for me.  The bright blue spot, the strong shadows, the fight for visual attention that is going on with the lettering, over saturated blues, the lettering behind the fence, the large black post and the sack on the bench.', '2007-07-20 09:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921165, 554344, 39429, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had fun building this "dslr."</td>', 'Looks like you had fun building this "dslr."', '2007-07-20 09:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921170, 554123, 39429, '<td valign="top">A beautiful, moment in time photo.  the lamp is interesting, while the details take this image to another level.  The lighting and composition speak strongly of purpose and skill.  The small imperfections add together to creat a moment in time feeling.  I especially love the water splash on the window.  Taken with the "clutter" on the table the image moves out of ordinary and into a peak into a serene life.</td>', 'A beautiful, moment in time photo.  the lamp is interesting, while the details take this image to another level.  The lighting and composition speak strongly of purpose and skill.  The small imperfections add together to creat a moment in time feeling.  I especially love the water splash on the window.  Taken with the "clutter" on the table the image moves out of ordinary and into a peak into a serene life.', '2007-07-20 09:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921242, 556527, 42100, '<td valign="top">Love this photo...very cute and adorable.  The technicals are great and the artistic just can''t be beat.  Excellent!</td>', 'Love this photo...very cute and adorable.  The technicals are great and the artistic just can''t be beat.  Excellent!', '2007-07-20 10:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921246, 555771, 42100, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and excellent execution to bring the concept to reality.  Great execution on the technicals...color and clarity are outstanding!</td>', 'Clever idea and excellent execution to bring the concept to reality.  Great execution on the technicals...color and clarity are outstanding!', '2007-07-20 10:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921258, 555026, 42100, '<td valign="top">You wouldn''t think of paper rolls as much of subject...but you developed this concept to create a masterful graphic art photograph.  Great job!</td>', 'You wouldn''t think of paper rolls as much of subject...but you developed this concept to create a masterful graphic art photograph.  Great job!', '2007-07-20 10:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921261, 554123, 42100, '<td valign="top">When you look at the challenge as a whole it seems almost out of place...I like how you went in a slightly different direction.  Not mention this photo while subtle, is a genuine beauty.  Great job!</td>', 'When you look at the challenge as a whole it seems almost out of place...I like how you went in a slightly different direction.  Not mention this photo while subtle, is a genuine beauty.  Great job!', '2007-07-20 10:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921266, 554624, 42100, '<td valign="top">Some many great textures here!  Excellent b&amp;w conversion and good use of DOF.  Very well done!</td>', 'Some many great textures here!  Excellent b&w conversion and good use of DOF.  Very well done!', '2007-07-20 10:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921306, 556331, 42100, '<td valign="top">Beautiful backdrop light and color...strong and well defined silhouette.  The combination works well and looks great.  It''s a pretty small detail, but I like the motion blur in the paper airplane.  Great photo!</td>', 'Beautiful backdrop light and color...strong and well defined silhouette.  The combination works well and looks great.  It''s a pretty small detail, but I like the motion blur in the paper airplane.  Great photo!', '2007-07-20 10:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921312, 556957, 56254, '<td valign="top">like the idea, colors and composition ... wish this were slightly sharper though ...</td>', 'like the idea, colors and composition ... wish this were slightly sharper though ...', '2007-07-20 10:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921313, 556412, 56254, '<td valign="top">LOL ... I''ve been there before ... hope you dig your way out ...</td>', 'LOL ... I''ve been there before ... hope you dig your way out ...', '2007-07-20 10:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921316, 557074, 56254, '<td valign="top">slightly more light on the left and not cutting off the right side would have made this stronger IMHO ... love the pattern and colors though ... neat idea ...</td>', 'slightly more light on the left and not cutting off the right side would have made this stronger IMHO ... love the pattern and colors though ... neat idea ...', '2007-07-20 10:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921317, 557046, 56254, '<td valign="top">looks like an alien llama!  nice lighting and good sharp focus</td>', 'looks like an alien llama!  nice lighting and good sharp focus', '2007-07-20 10:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921320, 556732, 56254, '<td valign="top">like the composition ... wish the paper were more of the focus of the image rather than the wax ...</td>', 'like the composition ... wish the paper were more of the focus of the image rather than the wax ...', '2007-07-20 10:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921327, 557066, 56254, '<td valign="top">nice DOF, colors and composition!</td>', 'nice DOF, colors and composition!', '2007-07-20 10:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921331, 557079, 56254, '<td valign="top">blown sky hurts this one ... could also use a slight boost of contrast to make the money really pop out of the image</td>', 'blown sky hurts this one ... could also use a slight boost of contrast to make the money really pop out of the image', '2007-07-20 10:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921332, 555151, 56254, '<td valign="top">very creative ... nice and sharp ... lighting on the back friend is a bit harsh ...</td>', 'very creative ... nice and sharp ... lighting on the back friend is a bit harsh ...', '2007-07-20 10:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921333, 557063, 56254, '<td valign="top">nice colors and compositon ...</td>', 'nice colors and compositon ...', '2007-07-20 10:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921334, 555020, 56254, '<td valign="top">wow ... this is great ... my pick for the blue, good luck!</td>', 'wow ... this is great ... my pick for the blue, good luck!', '2007-07-20 10:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921339, 556775, 56254, '<td valign="top">seems like a bit too much neat image was used ... skin and feather have lost the details ... nice b/w conversion and good composition</td>', 'seems like a bit too much neat image was used ... skin and feather have lost the details ... nice b/w conversion and good composition', '2007-07-20 10:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921341, 556527, 56254, '<td valign="top">Lesley?  this is really well done ... love the high contrast b/w conversion ... composition is strong adn DOF is great</td>', 'Lesley?  this is really well done ... love the high contrast b/w conversion ... composition is strong adn DOF is great', '2007-07-20 10:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921343, 556541, 56254, '<td valign="top">great idea ... strong composition ... lots of noise in the corn stalks ...</td>', 'great idea ... strong composition ... lots of noise in the corn stalks ...', '2007-07-20 10:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921349, 555592, 56254, '<td valign="top">harsh lighting hurts this one ... very creative ... how many post-it''s did you use?</td>', 'harsh lighting hurts this one ... very creative ... how many post-it''s did you use?', '2007-07-20 10:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921353, 555026, 56254, '<td valign="top">love the colors and composition here ... great job ...</td>', 'love the colors and composition here ... great job ...', '2007-07-20 10:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921354, 554890, 56254, '<td valign="top">fantastic colors and composition ... love the abstract feel to this one</td>', 'fantastic colors and composition ... love the abstract feel to this one', '2007-07-20 10:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921360, 556561, 56254, '<td valign="top">simple but very effective ... great job!</td>', 'simple but very effective ... great job!', '2007-07-20 10:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
