(3926222, 557042, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow, i''ve come to the Paper challenge for a brief look, as this particular challenge doesn''t really interest me. <br/>However i wasn''t expecting a shot like this.<br/>I love how the tones of the fly are similar to the background and manage to tie them together, whilst the bright white of the paper make it seem the odd one out in this shot.<br/>The composition is qually interesting. The angle of the paper and crop ask questions, such as what is the paper object? <br/>I like the wide aspect, along with the black framing aswell.<br/> <br/>I''ll vote this a 9, whether i manage another 24.9% of voting to make this stick i''m not sure however.</td>', 'Wow, i''ve come to the Paper challenge for a brief look, as this particular challenge doesn''t really interest me. However i wasn''t expecting a shot like this.I love how the tones of the fly are similar to the background and manage to tie them together, whilst the bright white of the paper make it seem the odd one out in this shot.The composition is qually interesting. The angle of the paper and crop ask questions, such as what is the paper object? I like the wide aspect, along with the black framing aswell. I''ll vote this a 9, whether i manage another 24.9% of voting to make this stick i''m not sure however.', '2007-07-22 18:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
