(3932429, 554890, 58452, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and colors. I wonder if this has strayed to far into the graphic realm of art for the voters at DPC.</td>', 'Interesting composition and colors. I wonder if this has strayed to far into the graphic realm of art for the voters at DPC.', '2007-07-24 16:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
