(3932509, 555458, 60984, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how you did this, but the scene is well thought of. Only the bee and the paper plane are the main subjects here. The bee is hard to discover from the background which is taking up way too much attention. Focus should only be on the bee and (partially) on the paper plane. The background would better be blur in this case. But that would probably make it an impossible shot.</td>', 'Don''t know how you did this, but the scene is well thought of. Only the bee and the paper plane are the main subjects here. The bee is hard to discover from the background which is taking up way too much attention. Focus should only be on the bee and (partially) on the paper plane. The background would better be blur in this case. But that would probably make it an impossible shot.', '2007-07-24 16:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
