(3932784, 554441, 80278, '<td valign="top">Almost didn''t get it. Subtle wit! Love it. This image gets better the more one looks. Simple, clean, elegant and witty. Nice treatment in the corners pushes the eye inwards. 8</td>', 'Almost didn''t get it. Subtle wit! Love it. This image gets better the more one looks. Simple, clean, elegant and witty. Nice treatment in the corners pushes the eye inwards. 8', '2007-07-24 18:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
