(3934059, 556417, 23487, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone!  I am so happy right now.  As you can see in the description, I reversed the colors to get the black Elvis cutout and make the background white/light gray.  Also, the shadow just happened due to the way the flash hit it.  I took about 20 shots at various angles, and when I saw this, I knew it was the one I wanted.</td>', 'Thanks everyone!  I am so happy right now.  As you can see in the description, I reversed the colors to get the black Elvis cutout and make the background white/light gray.  Also, the shadow just happened due to the way the flash hit it.  I took about 20 shots at various angles, and when I saw this, I knew it was the one I wanted.', '2007-07-25 01:21:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3934067, 555771, 52549, '<td valign="top">Yep, they definitely "got it" ;-) Big congrats on winning with this creative and excellent shot.</td>', 'Yep, they definitely "got it" ;-) Big congrats on winning with this creative and excellent shot.', '2007-07-25 01:23:23.000000', NULL, 0),
