(3934228, 554344, 78303, '<td valign="top">One person thought this did not meet the challenge, but I guess they did not notice it was made of PAPER.  Wow.<br/> <br/>I know I could have spent more time on this creation, but I put in just enought time to make me happy that I submitted something before I left on vacation.  I think I got the score I deserved, but still am confused as to people''s scoring ranges here.  4 people still thought this was the worst thing they saw and voted it a ''1''.  But, a nice bell curve, nonetheless.<br/> <br/></td>', 'One person thought this did not meet the challenge, but I guess they did not notice it was made of PAPER.  Wow. I know I could have spent more time on this creation, but I put in just enought time to make me happy that I submitted something before I left on vacation.  I think I got the score I deserved, but still am confused as to people''s scoring ranges here.  4 people still thought this was the worst thing they saw and voted it a ''1''.  But, a nice bell curve, nonetheless. ', '2007-07-25 01:44:54.000000', NULL, 0),
