(3934645, 556484, 61788, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for comments!<br/> <br/>From whole series I selected two shots: this one and #1 (to answer jjstager2''s question :) however #1 required some more editing and I didn''t have enough time (I''m moving) and then was going to violate advanced editing limits anyway. I will post #1 some time in August - it has little bit different lighting - some will consider better, some - worse :)<br/> <br/>I''m going to print #2 and see how it looks framed on the wall :)<br/> <br/>Well, I should add that I put the vase and fruits (for photokariangel: good question ;) on both sides of white object in the middle! lol ;) on one of empty bookshelves and enjoying view even now :)<br/> <br/>I cannot answer musichappens though: I don''t want to exclude the fact you mentioned :)<br/> <br/>See you all soon :)<br/></td>', 'Thank you everyone for comments! From whole series I selected two shots: this one and #1 (to answer jjstager2''s question :) however #1 required some more editing and I didn''t have enough time (I''m moving) and then was going to violate advanced editing limits anyway. I will post #1 some time in August - it has little bit different lighting - some will consider better, some - worse :) I''m going to print #2 and see how it looks framed on the wall :) Well, I should add that I put the vase and fruits (for photokariangel: good question ;) on both sides of white object in the middle! lol ;) on one of empty bookshelves and enjoying view even now :) I cannot answer musichappens though: I don''t want to exclude the fact you mentioned :) See you all soon :)', '2007-07-25 05:22:18.000000', NULL, 0),
