(3935116, 557075, 54232, '<td valign="top">This was a night shot so the coloring wasn''t that off ;)  Though the wb could have been set tungsten to lose the red glare.  Yes it was a bit noisy to bring out some of the  shadows and the whites did get a bit altered to tone down the bright light.  i thought more people would comment on the photo sliding off the frame.  i feel good knowing a gave people comfort in their own work to bash this ;)  i''m sad i got this close to the brown but couldn''t quite pull it off.</td>', 'This was a night shot so the coloring wasn''t that off ;)  Though the wb could have been set tungsten to lose the red glare.  Yes it was a bit noisy to bring out some of the  shadows and the whites did get a bit altered to tone down the bright light.  i thought more people would comment on the photo sliding off the frame.  i feel good knowing a gave people comfort in their own work to bash this ;)  i''m sad i got this close to the brown but couldn''t quite pull it off.', '2007-07-25 09:41:40.000000', NULL, 0),
