(3935151, 556527, 66348, '<td valign="top">Your work always seems to amaze me. Every picture you take seems to have a bit of a story to it. You capture the greatest expressions and feelings of people I think on DPC. I love your take on challenges and how you portray people. This is another spectacular shot. The editing is right on, and the title is just right. Thank you for continuing to bring us such amazing shots from where you live and keep up the great work!!</td>', 'Your work always seems to amaze me. Every picture you take seems to have a bit of a story to it. You capture the greatest expressions and feelings of people I think on DPC. I love your take on challenges and how you portray people. This is another spectacular shot. The editing is right on, and the title is just right. Thank you for continuing to bring us such amazing shots from where you live and keep up the great work!!', '2007-07-25 09:51:52.000000', NULL, 0),
