(3935707, 555771, 26001, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot everyone for votes, favorites and most importantly leaving nice comments throughout the week. Just because of these comments, I am actually happier with this ribbon than I was when I got the first ribbon.<br/>This is my third entry with an apple. Earlier entries were, <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=472582" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/637/thumb/472582.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/637/thumb/472582.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/637/thumb/472582.jpg"/></a> "torture" (challenge Hate) and <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=457109" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/622/thumb/457109.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/622/thumb/457109.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/622/thumb/457109.jpg"/></a> "exit wounds" (challenge Exit).<br/>I guess, my "apple fetish" finally delivered me a ribbon hehehe :)<br/>Thanks.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-25 12:03:51.</i></td>', 'Thanks a lot everyone for votes, favorites and most importantly leaving nice comments throughout the week. Just because of these comments, I am actually happier with this ribbon than I was when I got the first ribbon.This is my third entry with an apple. Earlier entries were,  "torture" (challenge Hate) and  "exit wounds" (challenge Exit).I guess, my "apple fetish" finally delivered me a ribbon hehehe :)Thanks.', '2007-07-25 12:30:42.000000', '2007-07-25 13:03:51.000000', 0),
