(3945984, 556527, 19708, '<td valign="top">Read the smile on my face oh boy.<br/>This just makes me smile. Thought about how funny it would look with their papers upside down, but with that serious look, it wouldn''t have had the impact this does, as it is. Congrats on another make it look so easy ribbon!</td>', 'Read the smile on my face oh boy.This just makes me smile. Thought about how funny it would look with their papers upside down, but with that serious look, it wouldn''t have had the impact this does, as it is. Congrats on another make it look so easy ribbon!', '2007-07-29 00:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
