(3946995, 557000, 45475, '<td valign="top">Oh my, Don, this is wonderful. For me, not sad at all. In fact, it''s a celebration. I wish I''d gotten around to voting.</td>', 'Oh my, Don, this is wonderful. For me, not sad at all. In fact, it''s a celebration. I wish I''d gotten around to voting.', '2007-07-29 18:28:06.000000', NULL, 0),
